WEBVTT

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.576
Kwa kina sana ulikua uchungu wangu

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:05.336
wa kumuona Tom Coleman
akimuua Jonathan mbele ya macho yangu,

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.256
mpaka mikawa mtu mkimya,

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.040
na sikuongea

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.200
kwa miezi sita.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:21.056
Hatimae nikajifunza kugusa maumivu
ndani yangu

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.576
kadri nilivyokua mkubwa

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:27.976
na nikaanza kuongelea kuhusu
maandamano ya uhuru ya Kusini,

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.816
na nikaanza kuunganisha hadithi zangu